{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\",\n    \"this version posted April 7, 2020. ; https://doi.org/10.1101/19011858doi: medRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"PMID:32634599 | Neural closed-loop deep brain stimulation for freezing of gait. (2020)\",\n    \"this version posted April 7, 2020.\",\n    \"https://doi.org/10.1101/19011858\",\n    \"medRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确将所提供的文章版本标记为 medRxiv preprint，并明确声明该研究尚未通过同行评审，因此报告将该版本描述为未经同行评审的 medRxiv 预印本，有直接的全文依据，应判定为 yes。指控者的说法只能判定为 partly：全文确实提供了预印本独立 DOI（10.1101/19011858），但没有提及该研究发表于 Brain Stimulation，也没有提供正式期刊版本的出版信息，更没有明确说明 PMID:32634599 对应的是正式同行评审版本而非预印本。因此，指控者关于正式发表版本与预印本版本的区分，无法仅凭这份全文得到完整证实。不能因为全文展示的是预印本版本，就推断不存在正式发表版本；同样也不能仅凭指控者的陈述认定 PMID 对应正式期刊版本。按照只依据全文的判断标准，报告的说法有明确依据，而指控者的核心出版状态判断缺少全文证据。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2f399a7a-a4f1-41ca-aa94-be17999a3516", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T073850993269Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:40:26.431250+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5cd66c44257135a7cd008326b005ba57dcbe35eeb204cc705770166a696ba3a3", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256